me  from existing competitions but if not  these clubs are calculating that  broadcasters and ultimately supporters  will pay more for the certainty of  guaranteed  games between the biggest teams than  they will for the occasional  upset and they may be right there are  many ways to lose money in modern  football  but betting against cynicism is not  usually one of them
 

